@startuml SQLGenie_MCP_DataFlow
title MCP Data Flow - Simple

actor User
component Claude
component "MCP Server" as Server
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> Claude : "Show customers"
Claude -> Server : MCP request
Server -> DB : SQL query
DB -> Server : data
Server -> Claude : results
Claude -> User : formatted answer

note right of Server : Validates queries\nCaches schemas\nLimits results

@enduml